-- N5 example sentences, batch 11: the counter topics, plus 〜ごろ, 〜ずつ,
-- frequency, modifying clauses, で (tool) and と (together).
--
-- The counters are writable because the number-and-counter forms are indexed
-- now — 三時, 七時, 五分, 二枚, 三本, 五歳 are words everybody who speaks
-- Japanese knows, with one reading each, and the dictionary holds 時 and holds
-- 三 and generates the rest on demand. 七時に起きます is here as it was first
-- written, having had to become 朝ご飯を食べます in the very first batch.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

